{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121610","id":4101876152,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc70fam4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121610","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121610.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121610.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121610","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121610/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121610/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121610/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/876a40b8ec32d9da9af9fc560ed58ab330d09317","number":121610,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Metal: Fix Forward+ light clustering black squares","user":{"login":"theomonnom","id":14841632,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODQxNjMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14841632?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theomonnom","html_url":"https://github.com/theomonnom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theomonnom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theomonnom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theomonnom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theomonnom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theomonnom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theomonnom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theomonnom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theomonnom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theomonnom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #121201\r\n\r\n`cluster_render.glsl` picks one thread per group to do the `atomicOr` instead of all of them writing the same thing. Helper threads normally get skipped via `gl_HelperInvocation`.\r\n\r\nOn Apple/Metal `gl_HelperInvocation` is unreliable, so that skip got turned off; but the \"pick one thread\" part stayed. The picked thread can be a helper thread, and Metal throws away helper thread writes, so the light bit never lands and the tile ends up black.\r\n\r\nFix: when we can't trust the helper check, don't pick one thread; let them all write. `atomicOr` writing the same bit twice is harmless, and Metal already drops the helper threads' writes.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25",